[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アンペル、そちらに行きました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel, over there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、任せろ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave it to me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで終わりだ――はああっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This ends now—HAAH!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これで邪魔者は片付いたな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That takes care of our unwelcome guest."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "無駄のない一撃でした、お見事です。\n大した腕前ですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A precise strike, well done.\nYour technique is quite impressive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この服のおかげだろうな。\n格段に機動力が上がっている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's thanks to these clothes.\nThey've greatly improved my mobility."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミーケとディオーナの職人としての腕前は、\n素晴らしいですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke and Diona's craftsmanship is truly remarkable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えへへ、それほどでもあるかなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe, you're too kind!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、初めて組むのにすごく息ぴったりだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two work amazingly well together for your first time teaming up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうでしょうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かに、妙にしっくり来る感じはするな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There is a certain natural rhythm to it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "波長、とでもいうのだろうか。\nそれが似ているのかもしれないな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps we're on the same wavelength,\nso to speak."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言われてみると、そんな気もしますが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that you mention it, I suppose I can see that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "似てる？\u3000似てる……んー？\n……あっ！\u3000分かった！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Similar? Similar... hmm?\n...Oh! I got it!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プラフタとアンペルって、誰かに似てると思ったら\nミーケのばーちゃんに似てるんだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I knew you two reminded me of someone—\nyou're just like my grandma!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ばーちゃん？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Grandma?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、落ち着き方が、そっくり！\nだから今も二人といると、心が安らぐんだよねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, you've got the same calming presence!\nThat's why being around you two feels so peaceful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミーケ、ばーちゃんのシワシワの手で\nよしよしされるの好きだったなー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I used to love it when Grandma would pat my head\nwith her soft, weathered hands..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぷぷぷ……ばーちゃんだって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pfft... Grandma, she says..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ソフィー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごめんなさい。この子に、悪気はないの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please forgive her. She didn't mean anything by it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ディオーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Diona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私は別に構わんが。\nそれなりに歳を重ねているのは事実だからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I don't mind.\nI am getting on in years, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、私もそれは否定しませんが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, I won't deny that either..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "熟練の錬金術士同士、\n気が合ったのかもしれませんわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perhaps it's just two seasoned alchemists\nfinding common ground."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、アンペルは「老獪」と言ったほうが\n正しいかもしれませんが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though in Empel's case, 'crafty old fox'\nmight be more accurate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前さんはもう少し悪気を隠す努力をしてくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're not even trying to be nice about it anymore, are you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]